 "task": "A business phone system",
 "summary": "Toll-free and vanity phone numbers for business, with call tracking, routing and analytics — plus 800 AI Agents (launched 2026) that answer calls, book appointments and filter spam when nobody picks up.",
 "best_for": "businesses that want a professional toll-free or vanity number with call tracking, routing and analytics to look bigger and measure inbound calls",
 "skip_if": "you need a full unified-comms suite (video, chat, contact center), or you already have a phone system and just need occasional forwarding",
 "honest_knock": "It does one thing cleanly: toll-free and vanity numbers with call tracking and routing. But it's a phone-number layer, not a full business-comms platform, so you won't get team chat, video or a contact center here. The 250-minute cap on Startup (it was 1,000 in August) matters for any real call volume, and the step up to Small Business more than doubles the bill. For a business that mainly wants a professional toll-free presence and call analytics, it's straightforward and fairly priced. The 2026 AI Agents (auto-answering, appointment booking, spam filtering) are the newest piece and now sit behind a separately priced AI Plan, so treat them as young rather than proven.",
