  "notes": "(re-verified 2026-10-06, read on their own plans page with the full comparison open) No free tier, and the line-up is down to two self-serve plans plus Enterprise. On yearly billing: Startup $19/mo and Small Business $49/mo; month to month the same two are $23 and $59. The yearly toggle is badged 2 MONTHS FREE (it read SAVE 15% in August); on these prices the yearly rate is about 17% lower ($19 against $23, $49 against $59). Enterprise is quote-only. Startup covers 250 minutes (1,000 in our 13 August read), 1 number, 1 user, 1 extension and 120 texts, with extra minutes and texts at $0.06. Small Business covers 3 numbers (toll-free, local or vanity), unlimited users and extensions, 500 texts at $0.04 beyond that, and minutes listed as unlimited subject to the Fair Usage Policy. Extra numbers are $15 each on both plans. The older Complete plan ($99 yearly, $119 monthly in August) no longer appears, and AI Agents now sit behind a separate AI Plan whose price we could not read. Every plan carries a 30-day money-back guarantee.",
